# Unit08
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit08核心词汇

challenge/ˈtʃælɪndʒ/挑战/Facing challenges helps us grow.
champion/ˈtʃæmpiən/冠军/She became the world champion in swimming.
chance/tʃæns/机会；可能性/Don't miss this chance to study abroad.
change/tʃeɪndʒ/改变；零钱/Climate change is a global concern.
channel/ˈtʃænl/频道；渠道/The TV channel shows documentaries.
chapter/ˈtʃæptər/章节/Please read the first chapter of the book.
character/ˈkærəktər/性格；角色/She has a kind and gentle character.
charge/tʃɑːrdʒ/收费；指控/How much do you charge for delivery?
charity/ˈtʃærəti/慈善；慈善机构/She donated money to a local charity.
chart/tʃɑːrt/图表/The chart shows the sales data for this year.
chase/tʃeɪz/追赶；追逐/The dog chased the cat around the yard.
cheap/tʃiːp/便宜的；廉价的/This shirt was very cheap.
cheat/tʃiːt/作弊；欺骗/He was caught cheating on the exam.
check/tʃek/检查；支票/Please check your answers before submitting.
cheek/tʃiːk/脸颊/She kissed him on the cheek.
cheer/tʃɪr/欢呼；鼓励/The crowd cheered when the team scored.
chemical/ˈkemɪkl/化学的；化学品/The factory produces chemical products.
chest/tʃest/胸部；箱子/He felt a pain in his chest.
chicken/ˈtʃɪkɪn/鸡肉/We had chicken and rice for dinner.
chief/tʃiːf/主要的；首领/The chief reason for his success is hard work.
child/tʃaɪld/儿童/Children need love and care.
choice/tʃɔɪs/选择/You have to make a choice between the two options.
choose/tʃuːz/选择/She chose to study medicine.
Christmas/ˈkrɪsməs/圣诞节/Merry Christmas to you and your family.
church/tʃɜːrtʃ/教堂/They go to church every Sunday.
cigarette/ˌsɪɡəˈret/香烟/Smoking cigarettes is bad for your health.
cinema/ˈsɪnəməa/电影院/We went to the cinema to watch a movie.
circle/ˈsɜːrkl/圆；圈子/She drew a circle on the paper.
circumstance/ˈsɜːrkəmstæns/情况；环境/Under the circumstances, we had no choice.
citizen/ˈsɪtɪzn/公民/Every citizen has the right to vote.
city/ˈsɪti/城市/Shanghai is one of the largest cities in the world.
civil/ˈsɪvl/公民的；文明的/Civil rights are protected by law.
claim/kleɪm/声称；要求/He claims to be an expert in the field.
clash/klæʃ/冲突；碰撞/The two groups clashed over the issue.
class/klæs/班级；课程/She is the top student in her class.
classic/ˈklæsɪk/经典的/This is a classic example of modern architecture.
classroom/ˈklæsruːm/教室/The classroom is clean and well-lit.
clean/kliːn/清洁的/Please keep the room clean and tidy.
clear/klɪr/清楚的；清澈的/The instructions are very clear.
clerk/klɜːrk/职员；店员/The clerk at the store was very helpful.
clever/ˈklevər/聪明的/She is a clever and resourceful girl.
client/ˈklaɪənt/客户；委托人/The lawyer met with his client this morning.
climate/ˈklaɪmət/气候/The climate here is warm and humid.
climb/klaɪm/攀登/We climbed to the top of the mountain.
cling/klɪŋ/紧抓；附着/The child clung to her mother's hand.
clock/klɑːk/时钟/The clock on the wall shows 3 o'clock.
close/kloʊz/关闭；靠近/Please close the door when you leave.
cloth/klɔːθ/布料/She wiped the table with a damp cloth.
clothes/kloʊðz/衣服/She bought some new clothes for the winter.
cloud/klaʊd/云/The dark clouds suggest it's going to rain.
